# Unit28
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 必考词Unit28核心词汇

significance/sɪɡˈnɪfɪkəns/重要性/The discovery has great significance.
significant/sɪɡˈnɪfɪkənt/重大的/There has been a significant improvement.
simplify/ˈsɪmplɪfaɪ/简化/We need to simplify the process.
simultaneously/ˌsaɪməlˈteɪniəsli/同时地/Both events happened simultaneously.
skeptical/ˈskeptɪkl/怀疑的/He is skeptical about the new policy.
slight/slaɪt/轻微的/There is a slight difference.
soar/sɔːr/飙升/Prices have soared recently.
sole/soʊl/唯一的/She is the sole survivor.
solemn/ˈsɑːləm/庄严的/He made a solemn promise.
sophisticated/səˈfɪstɪkeɪtɪd/复杂的/This is sophisticated equipment.
specific/spəˈsɪfɪk/具体的/Please give specific details.
speculate/ˈspekjuleɪt/推测/Scientists speculate about the origin.
sphere/sfɪr/领域/She works in the sphere of education.
spiritual/ˈspɪrɪtʃuəl/精神的/She has a strong spiritual life.
stable/ˈsteɪbl/稳定的/The country has a stable economy.
statistic/stəˈtɪstɪk/统计/The statistics show a clear trend.
status/ˈsteɪtəs/地位/He has a high social status.
steady/ˈstedi/稳定的/There has been a steady increase.
stem/stem/来源于/The problem stems from poor management.
stimulate/ˈstɪmjuleɪt/刺激/The policy will stimulate growth.
strategy/ˈstrætədʒi/策略/We need a new strategy.
strengthen/ˈstreŋθən/加强/We should strengthen cooperation.
stress/stres/压力/She is under a lot of stress.
strict/strɪkt/严格的/The school has strict rules.
strike/straɪk/罢工/The workers went on strike.
strive/straɪv/努力/She strives for excellence.
structure/ˈstrʌktʃər/结构/The structure of the building is strong.
submit/səbˈmɪt/提交/Please submit your report by Friday.
substance/ˈsʌbstəns/物质/Water is a colorless substance.
substantial/səbˈstænʃl/大量的/He made a substantial donation.
substitute/ˈsʌbstɪtuːt/替代品/Sugar is a poor substitute for honey.
subtle/ˈsʌtl/微妙的/There is a subtle difference.
sufficient/səˈfɪʃnt/足够的/There is sufficient evidence.
supplement/ˈsʌplɪmənt/补充/Vitamins are a good supplement.
supreme/suːˈpriːm/最高的/The Supreme Court made the decision.
surplus/ˈsɜːrpləs/剩余/The country has a trade surplus.
surround/səˈraʊnd/包围/The lake is surrounded by mountains.
survey/ˈsɜːrveɪ/调查/We conducted a survey on habits.
survive/sərˈvaɪv/生存/Only a few species survived.
suspect/səˈspekt/怀疑/The police suspect him of theft.
suspend/səˈspend/暂停/Operations were suspended during the crisis.
sustain/səˈsteɪn/维持/The country sustained heavy losses.
symbol/ˈsɪmbl/象征/The dove is a symbol of peace.
sympathy/ˈsɪmpəθi/同情/She expressed sympathy for the victims.
symptom/ˈsɪmptəm/症状/Fever is a common symptom.
tackle/ˈtækl/处理/We need to tackle this problem.
target/ˈtɑːrɡɪt/目标/The company set a sales target.
technique/tekˈniːk/技术/She learned a new technique.
temporary/ˈtempəreri/暂时的/This is only a temporary solution.
tendency/ˈtendənsi/倾向/There is a tendency for prices to rise.
